# The Node.js SDK is published from sdk/nodejs/bin (see `nodejs_sdk` in the
# Makefile and the publish_sdks job in .github/workflows/release.yml), where
# tsc has emitted the JavaScript and .d.ts files. This file is copied into bin/
# and also acts as a safety net: without an .npmignore, npm falls back to
# .gitignore, which excludes bin/ and would publish a tarball with no JS.
node_modules/
tsconfig.json
yarn.lock
*.ts
!*.d.ts
